# Contact form delivery runs through Cloudflare Email Routing — no third-party
# provider and no env vars in this file.
#
#   wrangler.jsonc  →  CONTACT_TO_EMAIL / CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL vars
#                      and the CONTACT_EMAIL send_email binding
#   wrangler secret →  CONTACT_INTERNAL_KEY (gates the internal send route)
#
# See custom-worker.js and the README "Contact form" section. Without the
# Workers runtime (plain `next dev`) submissions are validated and logged
# server-side but NOT emailed.
